-When an event type needs to evolve, you don't rewrite history — you describe how to read old events as the new shape with an [event type migration](./event-type-migrations). Prefer *adding* a new event or field over overloading an existing event; it keeps each fact singular and clear. See the recipe: [Evolve an event's shape](../scenarios/evolve-an-event.md).
